      "dcterms:title": "GEOMETRIC TRIANGULATIONS OF A FAMILY OF HYPERBOLIC 3-BRAIDS",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "NIMERSHIEM, BARBARA"
      ],
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20220624",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2108.09349",
      "dcterms:abstract": "We construct topological triangulations for complements of (−2, 3, n)-pretzel knots and links with n ≥7. Following a procedure outlined by Futer and Gu´eritaud, we use a theorem of Casson and Rivin to prove the constructed triangulations are geometric. Futer, Kalfagianni, and Purcell have shown (indirectly) that such braids are hyperbolic. The new result here is a direct proof.",
